1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:02,269
- You ready to order?
- One moment.

2
00:00:02,477 --> 00:00:04,187
(Sheldon:)I'm conducting an experiment.

3
00:00:05,104 --> 00:00:07,984
(Howard:)With Dungeons and Dragons dice?

4
00:00:08,816 --> 00:00:10,776
(Sheldon:)Yes. From here on in...

5
00:00:10,985 --> 00:00:14,485
(Sheldon:)...I've decided to make all trivial
decisions with a throw of the dice.

6
00:00:14,656 --> 00:00:17,036
(Sheldon:)Thus freeing up my mind
to do what it does best...

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,580
(Sheldon:)...enlighten and amaze.

8
00:00:21,371 --> 00:00:25,081
(Sheldon:)Page 14, item seven.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,170
(Howard:)So, what's for dinner?

10
00:00:27,335 --> 00:00:29,875
(Sheldon:)A side of corn succotash.

11
00:00:31,047 --> 00:00:33,297
(Sheldon:)Hmm, interesting.

12
00:00:33,466 --> 00:00:35,506
(Penny:)Um, Howard,
can I see you for a minute, please?

13
00:00:35,677 --> 00:00:40,767
Ugh, I don't wanna show any more of your
friends how I can fit in the booster seats.

14
00:00:41,808 --> 00:00:44,018
(Penny:)Uh, no, that's not it.
Just come with me, please?

15
00:00:46,062 --> 00:00:49,812
(Sheldon:)Let's see what I'll be washing
that succotash down with.

16
00:00:51,693 --> 00:00:56,023
(Sheldon:)A pitcher of margaritas.

